stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Inspect
    Inspect --> Accepted: complete proof
    Inspect --> Refused: other failure
    Inspect --> Waiting: member ID refused
    Waiting --> Inspect: retry budget remains
    Waiting --> Refused: budget ended or cancelled
    Accepted --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    note right of Waiting
        Two-second monotonic window.
        Each probe remains bounded.
        No placeholder grants authority.
    end note
